    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Completely Stretchy is a first-person exploration and 3D platformer set in the strange and wonderful Grombi Isles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> After you and Dr Grimble experience a rough day at the Elektro factory, you find yourself transformed - with a blue, stretchy, and sticky body!? Fellow denizens may be befuddled by your new look, and to make matters worse, the Elektros have escaped containment and are now scattered around the Isles!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Harness your newfound stretchiness to climb, swing and stick across this bizarre world. Track down the hidden Elektros to restore power and unravel the mystery of what happened to you. Why are you so stretchy, and blue?  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1587570/extras/195b5205b2dc8a7256d4dc31ef084355.poster.avif?t=1754045390\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1587570/extras/195b5205b2dc8a7256d4dc31ef084355.webm?t=1754045390\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1587570/extras/195b5205b2dc8a7256d4dc31ef084355.mp4?t=1754045390\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2728Swing, Climb and Stick: Use your hand to grab onto surfaces and swing across the world, finding hidden items to help you in your endeavours</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd90\ufe0f Lend a Hand: Help the quirky and curious inhabitants of the Grombi isles (Scrimbli, Chunkos and more) and get your hand on some stretchy upgrades</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\uddfa\ufe0f Reach New Heights: Explore three different regions with unique quests, activities and secrets</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udf44 Hands-On Fun: Jump on a hoverbike, dunk a few baskets and discover all you can do</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83e\udd14 Sticky Situations: Talking to locals will help you understand more about this strange place <br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1587570/extras/265102e9be03201015a3e16cc394cc3b.poster.avif?t=1754045390\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1587570/extras/265102e9be03201015a3e16cc394cc3b.webm?t=1754045390\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1587570/extras/265102e9be03201015a3e16cc394cc3b.mp4?t=1754045390\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Completely Stretchy is a first-person exploration and 3D platformer set in the strange and wonderful Grombi Isles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> After you and Dr Grimble experience a rough day at the Elektro factory, you find yourself transformed - with a blue, stretchy, and sticky body!? Fellow denizens may be befuddled by your new look, and to make matters worse, the Elektros have escaped containment and are now scattered around the Isles!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Harness your newfound stretchiness to climb, swing and stick across this bizarre world. Track down the hidden Elektros to restore power and unravel the mystery of what happened to you. Why are you so stretchy, and blue?  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1587570/extras/195b5205b2dc8a7256d4dc31ef084355.poster.avif?t=1754045390\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1587570/extras/195b5205b2dc8a7256d4dc31ef084355.webm?t=1754045390\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1587570/extras/195b5205b2dc8a7256d4dc31ef084355.mp4?t=1754045390\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2728Swing, Climb and Stick: Use your hand to grab onto surfaces and swing across the world, finding hidden items to help you in your endeavours</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd90\ufe0f Lend a Hand: Help the quirky and curious inhabitants of the Grombi isles (Scrimbli, Chunkos and more) and get your hand on some stretchy upgrades</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\uddfa\ufe0f Reach New Heights: Explore three different regions with unique quests, activities and secrets</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udf44 Hands-On Fun: Jump on a hoverbike, dunk a few baskets and discover all you can do</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83e\udd14 Sticky Situations: Talking to locals will help you understand more about this strange place <br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1587570/extras/265102e9be03201015a3e16cc394cc3b.poster.avif?t=1754045390\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1587570/extras/265102e9be03201015a3e16cc394cc3b.webm?t=1754045390\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1587570/extras/265102e9be03201015a3e16cc394cc3b.mp4?t=1754045390\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p></li></ul>",
